sequenceDiagram
    participant Client Code
    participant OWLFeeder
    participant RuleMatrixCompiler
    participant MEELEngine
    participant CanonicalHypertensor
    Client Code->>OWLFeeder: ingest(owl_file)
    OWLFeeder->>RuleMatrixCompiler: compile(ast_nodes)
    RuleMatrixCompiler->>CanonicalHypertensor: update_mask_Si(compiled_rules)
    Client Code->>MEELEngine: deduce(query)
    MEELEngine->>CanonicalHypertensor: multiply(Vi, Si)
    CanonicalHypertensor->>MEELEngine: return new_Vi
    MEELEngine->>Client Code: return deduced_facts